libhdbpp-mysql (7.2.0-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Bind value_w in store_scalar only for writable attributes (patch 0001):
    every read-only scalar overflowed the MYSQL_BIND array, and the
    EventSubscriber crashed on the first event of a read-only DevState.

